<title>UK: WestLB adds 500 mln marks to Dec 2004 Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>WestLB adds 500 mln marks to Dec 2004 Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Bayerische Landesbank, DGZ, Landesbank Hessen Thueringen, Norddeutsche Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    16.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.30     PAY DATE  S-07.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    DUSS	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    11 BP     SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT NOVEMBER 2004 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES     *LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY FOR 1.0 BLN MARKS ON 10.JUN.97.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF REIHE 7504</p>
<p>	     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON PLUS ACCRUED FROM 16.JUN.97</p>
<p>		TO 07.JUL.97.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
